{"articleNo":"166525","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=166525&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[K-RC교육원]생활관 선착순 선발 메일 수신 확인 및 선발 마감","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.02.13","hit":"5137","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"5\">마감되었습니다.</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"5\">차후 발생여석은 선착순 후보자 순대로 연락 예정입니다.</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;현재 <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">13</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">오전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">10:02:03</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">초까지 수신된 메일 확인을 완료</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">하였습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">메일 확인 중</spa