롬바탕\">메일 수신 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">완료</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">되지 않은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">해당 발신메일을 답장하기 또는 전달하기를 통해</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><a href=\"mailto:h980213@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">h980213@kumoh.ac.kr</span></span></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">로 전송 후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">478-7943</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">으로 빠른 연락바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">메일 재발송 기한은 2017. 2. 14. 09:00분까지&nbsp;임을 알려드립니다</span>.</span></p><p class=